# [API_ORIGIN_V1] The docroot-wide `Header set Access-Control-Allow-Origin "*"`
# that lived here applied to EVERY file below it, including api.php and
# frognet_setup_v4_api.php. It let any page on the internet read this API from a
# browser on the FrogNet LAN. CORS is now decided per-endpoint, in PHP, against
# an allowlist of FrogNet origins - see the header block in api.php.
#
# Do not reinstate a wildcard here. If a new endpoint needs cross-origin access,
# give it the same origin check api.php uses.
